# CR 115's own "any target" (ValidTgts$ Any): a real Lightning Bolt cast at
# an opponent's planeswalker, outside combat -- dealDamageTargets
# (dealdamageeffect.go) reads the chosen target from Ability.Targets and
# calls dealPermanentDamage (combatdamage.go) the same shared function
# combat damage already uses, CR 120.3c's own loyalty-counter branch firing
# for a script-driven source for the first time.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
queue targets 3
castspell human 1
resolvestack
